			"notes": "### **Added Block Sensor**\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"2026-10-14_19 59 07\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8d1a97dd-d47f-46de-9287-de43c77109c9\" />\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"2026-10-14_20 02 32\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/06544afe-b895-4ade-bcba-1edd4080818a\" />\n\n### **Added Player Sensor Detection Modes**\n- Digital: Outputs full redstone output when players in radius\n- Analog: Outputs based on player distance\n- Count: Outputs based on player counts in radius"
