			"notes": "# **SensiCraft v1.0.0-alpha**\n\nThe first public alpha release of SensiCraft!\n\nSensiCraft adds configurable sensors to Minecraft that detect events and turn them into redstone signals.\n\n# **Included Sensors**\n- Mob Sensor which detects selected mobs such as Creepers, Skeletons, Zombies, and Spiders.\n- Player Sensor which detects players within a configurable radius.\n- Rain Sensor which simply detects rain and provides a redstone signal.\n\n# **Installation**\n- Install Fabric 26.2 Loader and Fabric API.\n- Download sensicraft-1.0.0-alpha.jar.\n- Place the jar in your Minecraft mods folder.\n- Launch Minecraft and enjoy SensiCraft!"
		}
